Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:21.14,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:23.22,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making fish out of leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:30.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:36.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one's a fish, and this is an octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that a starfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.38,0:00:42.36,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:47.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.63,0:00:57.90,Sign,SIGN (starfish sign),0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx78.25\fscy84.5\t(\fscx81.25\fscy87.5)\fad(482,0)\move(366,234,366,240)}Hall {\c&H494949&}of {\c&H0044AA&}\NThe Starfish - \N{\c&H047883&}The Book
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.82,0:01:04.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, do you want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.71,0:01:12.17,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A book about fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:12.33,Insert,SIGN (book title),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz11.183\pos(380,263)}Fish Drawing Book
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.33,0:01:12.41,Insert,SIGN (book title),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz9.063\pos(380,268)}Fish Drawing Book
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.41,0:01:13.16,Insert,SIGN (book title),0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(380,268)\frz8.332\clip(m 236 284 b 301 274 432 254 498 245 505 243 521 265 514 279 506 275 500 274 498 275 496 275 493 278 492 280 491 281 492 286 493 288 493 289 496 293 498 295 528 325 372 313 330 319 307 322 261 323 238 325)}Fish Drawing Book
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:20.89,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one's a salmon! It's kinda salty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:23.45,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're interested in eating them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.74,0:01:32.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, look. It's a flounder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.13,0:01:34.25,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Flounder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.25,0:01:37.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's a fish that has its eyes on the same side of its body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.81,0:01:40.70,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:45.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one looks like a puffer fish, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:48.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.37,0:01:58.70,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:05.26,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Cheating is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:08.30,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.30,0:02:10.31,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Cutting the leaves is considered cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:17.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't cheating. It's more like {\i1}adult's intelligence{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.19,0:02:28.38,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:33.25,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do? It's all wrinkly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:40.34,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,There are holes in the acorns!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.34,0:02:41.37,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Holes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Bugs, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:53.86,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, we had that happen here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.69,0:02:57.40,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,When I told Reina that she wasn't allowed to bring acorns inside the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.32,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,she threw a hissy fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:05.78,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do? The acorns have bugs in them, and the leaves are all dry and wrinkly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:09.73,Usaghi Main I,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Leaves? We pressed them between books.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:12.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pressed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.47,0:03:25.85,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:28.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Wash your hands first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:30.15,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,In a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:05.66,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:14.97,Copy of Insert,SIGN (scrapbook title),0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx90\fscy83.75\pos(304,88)\frx12\fry0\frz4.456}Aquarium of leaves
